Package: leonardo
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, default-jre-headless (>= 21)
Description: S3-compatible object storage server
 Leonardo turns a POSIX filesystem directory into an S3-compatible
 endpoint. It implements the AWS S3 REST API including buckets, objects,
 multipart uploads, versioning, object locking, lifecycle policies, ACLs,
 presigned URLs, and SigV4/SigV2 authentication.
